        "order": 18,
        "question": "An electric kettle rated 2.2 kW operates for 2 hours daily. If the cost of electricity is ₹5 per unit, what is the cost of operating the kettle for 30 days?",
        "type": "mcq",
        "options": [
          {
            "letter": "A",
            "text": "₹330",
            "isCorrect": false,
            "index": 0,
            "imageUrl": "",
            "explanation": ""
          },
          {
            "letter": "B",
            "text": "₹440",
            "isCorrect": false,
            "index": 1,
            "imageUrl": "",
            "explanation": ""
          },
          {
            "letter": "C",
            "text": "₹550",
            "isCorrect": false,
            "index": 2,
            "imageUrl": "",
            "explanation": ""
          },
          {
            "letter": "D",
            "text": "₹660",
            "isCorrect": true,
            "index": 3,
            "imageUrl": "",
            "explanation": ""
          }
        ],
        "answer": "",
        "alternateAnswers": [],
        "explanation": "Power (P) = 2.2 kW\nTime per day (t_day) = 2 hours\nTotal operating time for 30 days (T) = t_day × 30 = 2 hours/day × 30 days = 60 hours\nEnergy consumed (E) = P × T = 2.2 kW × 60 h = 132 kWh\nSince 1 unit = 1 kWh, Energy consumed = 132 units.\nCost of electricity = ₹5 per unit\nTotal cost = Energy consumed × Cost per unit = 132 units × ₹5/unit = ₹660.",
        "hint": "",
        "marks": 1,
        "negativeMark": 0,
        "negativeMarking": false,
        "imageUrl": "",
